{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/01.gif?t=1749491347\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/FAMILY-FRIENDLY!.png?t=1749491347\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Super Cloud Fight, a battle royale game where having fun is more important than winning. Gear up, goof off, and dive into the wildest ride where powerups and laughter reign supreme!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/Battle_in_the_skies_with_friends.png?t=1749491347\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/02.gif?t=1749491347\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge your skills and reflexes in this mesmerizing aerial ballet with your friends, where every twist and turn is a step towards becoming the ultimate airborne champions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/A_SQUAD_of_Silly_Spirit_Animals!.png?t=1749491347\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/04.png?t=1749491347\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet the wildest squad in the clouds! Super Cloud Fight\u2019s silly spirit animals, like the tiger, panthers, and one speedy rabbit (and more to come) \u2014 are here to bring the fun and fluff to every sky battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/Be_Bold_with_Painted_Planes.png?t=1749491347\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/05.png?t=1749491347\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why blend in when you can paint the skies? Customize your planes with bold colors and textures that show off your style and make your mark in our community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/LOTS_OF_FUN_FEATURES.png?t=1749491347\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The jet stream allows the player to recharge the plane and take a quick break from the dogfighting.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/06.gif?t=1749491347\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Boost your gameplay with a variety of powerups to gain the upper hand much like Super Mario Kart.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/07.gif?t=1749491347\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Zoom in for precision strikes or zoom out for the chaos! Master the skies with dynamic zoom and see your victories up close!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/08.gif?t=1749491347\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The throttle system lets you chase or evade enemies for adrenaline-pumping action supported by a radar view.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/09.gif?t=1749491347\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SkyPoints allows you to track your performance as a pilot. Earn more to unlock new characters and levels!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/10.gif?t=1749491347\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/Ready_to_sky_battle_.png?t=1749491347\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/11.gif?t=1749491347\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlist now to stay up-to-date with the latest development updates and be the first to know when Super Cloud Fight releases. Join our  Discord   community and get access to exclusive beta play sessions where you can help shape the game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3227860?t=1749491347","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3227860?t=1749491347","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/2d90bf58d1e7d59b3c5f9895a18fae32ab092928/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749491347","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/2d90bf58d1e7d59b3c5f9895a18fae32ab092928/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749491347","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Free to Play Version!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The premium version of <strong>Super Cloud Fight</strong> lets you play single player, battle across a selection of cloud levels, and stash SkyPoints! Want more? Upgrade for <strong>1500 SkyCoins</strong> (~$9.99) to unlock <strong>Multi-Player Mode</strong>, where the stakes\u2014and the gear\u2014are higher! You\u2019ll also get full access to the <strong>Marketplace</strong>,  and the <strong>Shared SkyPoints</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This premium version gives you a taste of the fun and lets returning players check out the new updates before going all in! \ud83c\udfae</p></p><br><h1>About the Demo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/01.gif?t=1749491347\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/FAMILY-FRIENDLY!.png?t=1749491347\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Super Cloud Fight, a battle royale game where having fun is more important than winning. Gear up, goof off, and dive into the wildest ride where powerups and laughter reign supreme!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/Battle_in_the_skies_with_friends.png?t=1749491347\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/02.gif?t=1749491347\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge your skills and reflexes in this mesmerizing aerial ballet with your friends, where every twist and turn is a step towards becoming the ultimate airborne champions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/A_SQUAD_of_Silly_Spirit_Animals!.png?t=1749491347\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/04.png?t=1749491347\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet the wildest squad in the clouds! Super Cloud Fight\u2019s silly spirit animals, like the tiger, panthers, and one speedy rabbit (and more to come) \u2014 are here to bring the fun and fluff to every sky battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/Be_Bold_with_Painted_Planes.png?t=1749491347\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/05.png?t=1749491347\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why blend in when you can paint the skies? Customize your planes with bold colors and textures that show off your style and make your mark in our community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/LOTS_OF_FUN_FEATURES.png?t=1749491347\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The jet stream allows the player to recharge the plane and take a quick break from the dogfighting.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/06.gif?t=1749491347\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Boost your gameplay with a variety of powerups to gain the upper hand much like Super Mario Kart.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/07.gif?t=1749491347\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Zoom in for precision strikes or zoom out for the chaos! Master the skies with dynamic zoom and see your victories up close!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/08.gif?t=1749491347\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The throttle system lets you chase or evade enemies for adrenaline-pumping action supported by a radar view.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/09.gif?t=1749491347\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SkyPoints allows you to track your performance as a pilot. Earn more to unlock new characters and levels!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/10.gif?t=1749491347\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/Ready_to_sky_battle_.png?t=1749491347\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/extras/11.gif?t=1749491347\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlist now to stay up-to-date with the latest development updates and be the first to know when Super Cloud Fight releases. Join our  Discord   community and get access to exclusive beta play sessions where you can help shape the game.</p>","developers":["Engaged AS"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2697730","name":"Super Cloud Fight"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/27e8fdfd7ee10d3be346bca6ed4303db2255b9d8/header.jpg?t=1749491347","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Super Cloud Fight, and all associated logos, illustrations, images, names, characters, races, airplanes, locations, weapons, powerups and the distinctive likeness thereof, are either \u00ae or TM, and/or \u00a9 Engaged AS, variably registered around the world, and used under license. All rights reserved to their respective owners.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257154203,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154203/movie480.mp4?t=1749484742","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154203/movie_max.mp4?t=1749484742"},"name":"Gameplay Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257154203/a6c3414204de76f95a160b2682dd3133241309da/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749484742","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154203/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749484742","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154203/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749484742"}}],"name":"Super Cloud Fight Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows Vista or greater<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 970 / R9 290, shader model 3.0+<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7400 / AMD Ryzen 5 1600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 1060 / Radeon 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Engaged AS"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cExcited to dive into this new online airplane game! As an aviation enthusiast, I'm eager to see how this simulates the thrill of taking flight. Let's see if my piloting skills translate into virtual skies!\u201d<br />\r\nUmmay<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cAbsolutely thrilled about this new online airplane game! Finally, a chance to soar through virtual skies and experience the adrenaline rush of aerial maneuvers. Can't wait to join fellow aviation enthusiasts in mastering the art of flight!\u201d<br />\r\nAlib<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cCompared to other games, this gaming model boasts excellent quality and a larger audience of fans.\u201d<br />\r\nAndroon<br />\r\n","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/b2bfdb5cccb5c69de0200cbcd1e682cb32e46afa/ss_b2bfdb5cccb5c69de0200cbcd1e682cb32e46afa.1920x1080.jpg?t=1749491347","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/b2bfdb5cccb5c69de0200cbcd1e682cb32e46afa/ss_b2bfdb5cccb5c69de0200cbcd1e682cb32e46afa.600x338.jpg?t=1749491347"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/a0bbd32c652a49549776c3fed4aa71114782a1ac/ss_a0bbd32c652a49549776c3fed4aa71114782a1ac.1920x1080.jpg?t=1749491347","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/a0bbd32c652a49549776c3fed4aa71114782a1ac/ss_a0bbd32c652a49549776c3fed4aa71114782a1ac.600x338.jpg?t=1749491347"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/e5e7bfb2d5d329be983840ffc4ca3edf4d7e11f9/ss_e5e7bfb2d5d329be983840ffc4ca3edf4d7e11f9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1749491347","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/e5e7bfb2d5d329be983840ffc4ca3edf4d7e11f9/ss_e5e7bfb2d5d329be983840ffc4ca3edf4d7e11f9.600x338.jpg?t=1749491347"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/d794ee2744b265cf0e0e0cb3fd52b675be0830db/ss_d794ee2744b265cf0e0e0cb3fd52b675be0830db.1920x1080.jpg?t=1749491347","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/d794ee2744b265cf0e0e0cb3fd52b675be0830db/ss_d794ee2744b265cf0e0e0cb3fd52b675be0830db.600x338.jpg?t=1749491347"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/c74bab31652ecd519cc7a80879a365f03de7f29b/ss_c74bab31652ecd519cc7a80879a365f03de7f29b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1749491347","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227860/c74bab31652ecd519cc7a80879a365f03de7f29b/ss_c74bab31652ecd519cc7a80879a365f03de7f29b.600x338.jpg?t=1749491347"}],"short_description":"Super Cloud Fight allows you to experience a unique way of aerial combat with customizable planes, special combat maneuvers and powerups. Play with AI bots, friends or competitors!","steam_appid":3227860,"support_info":{"email":"support@engaged.as","url":"https://supercloudfight.com/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"demo","website":"https://supercloudfight.com"}